Comment: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:22.13,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.11,0:12:29.14,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the Federation Forces have exhausted{\i}\N{\i1}their fighting strength.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:50.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In other words, they lack the strength{\i}\N{\i1}to take out Granada or A Baoa Qu.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As a result, they'll probably{\i}\N{\i1}Invade our homeland directly.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:55.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the sort of thing Revil would plan.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.39,0:01:59.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all the more reason why\Nwe must try to avoid further warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what the Solar Ray Is for.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:05.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll wipe out the Federation{\i}\N{\i1}with one blow, Father.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can do it... Right, Garma?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.91,0:02:15.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seeking to defuse a situation that was\Nno longer under his control Sovereign Degwin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:17.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...departed from the Principality of Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.52,0:02:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Supreme Commander Gihren Zabi,\Nof course, had not been informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've grown old, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's already too late...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.73,0:02:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Call from Captain Asakura,{\i}\N{\i1}the technical advisor.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:45.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Put him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Reporting, sir.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:50.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Solar Ray is now operational.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:55.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll reach critical point in two hours.{\i}\N{\i1}But, sir...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:03:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We had to use the critically permeable{\i}\N{\i1}membranes and polarized mirrors...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:04.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...that were created for testing purposes.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As a result, the Solar Ray system{\i}\N{\i1}can be fired only once.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are its capabilities as we predicted?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:10.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A 3-second continuous irradiation...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:16.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and an angle adjustment of{\i}\N{\i1}up to 12 degrees in that time.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am impressed.\NThe preparations must be flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Repairs to the Gelgoog should be finished\Nwithin 20 to 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once that's done,\Nwe'll commence our second wave of attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:36.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After we defeat the Trojan Horse's group,\Nwe'll head immediately for A Baoa Qu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:41.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our intelligence indicates that Revil's\Nmain fleet will ignore Granada.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:42.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:46.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But first, there's something\NI want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:50.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What made you abandon your plans\Nto overthrow the Zabi family?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My... plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:57.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I spent some time playing with young Casval\Nwhen he was about four years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:58.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:01.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever since you summoned me,\NLady Kycilia...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:04.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I knew that a time like this would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:07.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't make it any less frightening...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:09.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My hand won't stop shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I felt the same way...\Nwhen I found out about your identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:16.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And how did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:17.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was Lalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You had sent Lalah to the Flanagan Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:24.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I realized that you had\Nalmost clairvoyant insight...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...so I ordered a thorough investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:32.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah made you believe\Nin the existence of Newtypes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:35.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and you now have greater goals\Nthan overthrowing the Zabi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Correct...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gihren has taken command\Nat A Baoa Qu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:47.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything else will be dealt with\Nafter we defeat the Federation. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:58.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Newtypes, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So they're different from espers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:02.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:07.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But judging from what Amuro said,\Nthe enemy must have superhuman abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:09.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For now, let's assume so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:13.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can possibly fight\Nagainst an enemy like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I don't think it's that serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:20.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this, Amuro,\Nbut if that Tricorn Hat appears again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:24.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I'll take care of it...\NAt this point, I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true. Right now, you're exhibiting\NNewtype potential, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:34.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the only logical explanation\Nfor everything that's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inside of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But even if I am a Newtype,\NI'm not special!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the way we've been fighting, I think\Nall the White Base crew must be Newtypes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:49.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we couldn't have made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:52.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may have a point there...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:55.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I still sense something\Nextraordinary about you, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I won't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:06:02.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been especially convinced\Nsince encountering that Tricorn Hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And... that "la... la" sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.35,0:06:08.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain! We're in diamond formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:11.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good! Now hurry up and send out\Nall the mobile suit teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:16.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll stage an all-out assault on the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.55,0:06:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The goal is to sink at least half the vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, you'll deal with the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:27.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll head out in the Gelgoog, but this time\NI'll be following your orders, Lalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:29.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:32.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've surpassed me now, Lalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From now on, I want you to wear\Nyour normal suit whenever you sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:52.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:07.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mobile suit launching complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:11.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Assault formation assumed\Nwith Captain Char's Zanzibar in the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:12.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:15.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll hold here in the Gwazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,30 seconds after Captain Char launches,\Ngive him 30 seconds of covering fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.67,0:07:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy vessels are on the move!\NThey're passing the F-line!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:32.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai! Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:34.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Time to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.01,0:07:37.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about shifts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's leave things in their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:42.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Newtypes, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.64,0:07:46.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow! Make sure they launch quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:48.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn it, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,30 seconds! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope they'll be okay! We'd better have\Na place to return to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,10 degrees starboard, at 1:30!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:33.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're gonna change their course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:49.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four ships coming up portside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Put up a barrage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:09.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two vessels down on each side!\NThe enemy's started evasive action!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Anti-air fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.45,0:09:13.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll send in the mobile suits next!\NHere they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:17.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're in teams of 5 or 6. I see at least 15!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:29.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:36.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:44.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here comes the Tricorn Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it! The control...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can sense it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La... la...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A... mu... ro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:09.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.19,0:11:14.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you fighting, Lalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you'll hurt Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.49,0:11:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a bad person, trying to harm Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:22.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.05,0:11:34.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The strength you're displaying tells me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...if I don't defeat you, Char will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:40.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char?! ...S-So that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you arrived too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too late...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:49.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why... Why did you have to appear now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why...? How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:59.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you keep fighting like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:03.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have no one to defend\Nand nothing to protect, and yet...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to protect?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:07.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can see that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...there's no family in your heart.\NAnd no homeland either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what's your point?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.99,0:12:39.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:55.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it wrong of me to fight\Nif I have nothing to defend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:12:59.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what are you doing, Lalah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:04.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting for the one person\Nwho saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:08.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it... There's nothing else?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:12.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... It's a truth that one lives for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:15.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does it mean nothing that we met?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:23.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, was this destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... I believe so.\NI think this was destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:34.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:37.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this is fate... then life is just too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we have to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah, open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:47.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? Could you really be right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.52,0:13:49.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it fate, as you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:51.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:53.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... why now?!\NWhy now, of all times?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.49,0:14:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because we're all burdened\Nwith our own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah! Stop fooling around with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:55.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Please pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:57.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous! Stay back, Ms. Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:04.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's me! Can't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:09.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah! I need to crush that Gundam!\NGive your guidance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:12.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.23,0:15:14.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll help you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:16.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll help you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lalah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.69,0:15:20.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:23.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you take Lalah away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:24.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain, you're too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:55.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.95,0:15:59.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Artesia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.61,0:16:14.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char! You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:26.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:43.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}People are changing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.99,0:16:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're becoming like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:49.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right about that, Lalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:54.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro, do you honestly believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:01.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You and I were able\Nto understand each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.33,0:17:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One day people will even\Nbe able to control time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can see time itself...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:35.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La... Lalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've done something terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've done something I can never take back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:52.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get the Zanzibar!\NConcentrate all fire on the Zanzibar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:56.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just get the Trojan Horse! Just that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the Gwazine is our only remaining ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.61,0:19:24.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:25.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:29.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam pilot's Newtype abilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:32.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...are becoming even greater.\NIt's overwhelming...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:36.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Kycilia, we've received orders from{\i}\N{\i1}Supreme Commander Gihren at A Baoa Qu.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:37.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Federation's main fleet{\i}\N{\i1}Is heading for A Baoa Qu.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:45.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All Zeon fleets In the Solar Ray's firing path{\i}\N{\i1}are to retreat immediately.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The operation will commence at 21:05.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:52.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me...\NThey're using the Solar Ray in 30 minutes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Solar Ray?\NThey're going to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too rash...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:02.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's Gihren plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.49,0:20:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to be late to the rendezvous\Nwith the main fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:09.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai. Can the Salamis behind us keep up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:11.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I doubt it. Let's go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:13.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But will they be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are no more Zeons in this airspace,\Nso they'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, the Newtype that challenged Amuro\Nis no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:27.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I can still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Haro? I'm doing fine, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:35.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro, brainwave level excellent!\NExcellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.11,0:20:38.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:40.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the meantime...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.23,0:20:43.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Earth Federation fleet,\Nled by General Revil...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:48.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...was gathering at the third battle line\Nleading to A Baoa Qu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:53.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was at this point that General Revil\Nannounced their target.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.15,0:20:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They were to fight past A Baoa Qu,\Nand invade the Zeon homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:21:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Great Degwin has arrived\Nfor peace negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.74,0:21:25.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But at that very moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Gihren speaking from A Baoa Qu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.55,0:21:30.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will now announce the final target\Nof the Solar Ray system.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The main forces of the enemy's Revil Fleet...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:34.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...are split into three groups.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if we aim the Solar Ray at Gel Dorva...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:41.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...we should be able to take out{\i}\N{\i1}a third of their forces.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Solar Ray system...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...stand by!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:47.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.53,0:21:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Solar Ray system, stand by!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.15,0:21:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Generator systems: no problems!\NMicrowave transmitters: operational!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Output: 8500 gigawatts per hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adjust firing angle... down 012, right 0032!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:05.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Primary target is Gel Dorva!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.20,0:22:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Musai over generator system 825! Clear out!\NYour shadow will lower our output!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.44,0:23:01.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do it! Don't move forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.74,0:23:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People are melting in a whirlpool of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:12.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1778)}That's the light of hatred!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.42,0:23:22.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will the rivalry between Gihren and Kycilia\Ndrive Zeon into a crisis?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:27.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The surviving members of the Earth\NFederation Forces stage their final assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:28.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Char, too, makes a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.83,0:23:31.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Amuro almost seems\Nto follow Lalah's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.90,0:23:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NSpace Fortress: A Baoa Qu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:40.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
